  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/04/GustavoParadisMana2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(37 fotos) Man&aacute; Bar, en la calle 8 de Marzo de Onda, ha celebrado el Domingo de Pascua nuevamente con una comida con todo el local y la terraza completos, y con otra</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/04/GustavoParadisMana1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>actuaci&oacute;n de Gustavo Parad&iacute;s y sus versiones pop y rock.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manabargustavoparadis/img_6555.jpg\" alt=\"img_6555\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manabargustavoparadis/img_6558.jpg\" alt=\"img_6558\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manabargustavoparadis/img_6560.jpg\" alt=\"img_6560\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manabargustavoparadis/img_6568.jpg\" alt=\"img_6568\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manabargustavoparadis/img_6572.jpg\" alt=\"img_6572\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manabargustavoparadis/img_6573.jpg\" alt=\"img_6573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manabargustavoparadis/img_6574.jpg\" alt=\"img_6574\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manabargustavoparadis/img_6577.jpg\" alt=\"img_6577\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manaba